    "title": "MICROSERVICE-shashil-Create Hotel Rooms Hold-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Hotel Room Reservation API allows users to hold hotel rooms for specified dates, ensuring availability for guests. This endpoint is crucial for travel agencies and booking platforms that need to secure accommodations before finalizing customer reservations. By managing room holds, businesses can enhance the customer experience by preventing overbooking and ensuring that tenants have guaranteed options. Typical consumers of this API include travel operators and hotel management systems seeking efficient room management solutions.",
